      "title_zh": "提案封面：京张令牌识别装置",
      "title_en": "Proposal cover: the Token Block identity device",
      "description_zh": "一条实线在三处按真实里程断开为虚线（三站），线上方两枚菱形为两处道岔；断点位置由三处重点片区形心在主脊 ROAD-001 上的里程投影计算，非手工摆放。概念方案，非官方渲染。",
      "description_en": "One solid rule broken into dashed segments at the three stations, with two diamonds for the two switches. Break positions are computed from the projected chainage of the three key-area centroids on the ROAD-001 main-line alignment. Conceptual, not an official rendering."
