      "language": "zh",
      "title_zh": "跑一枚令牌：离线三维走廊交互",
      "title_en": "Run a Token: offline 3D corridor interactive",
      "description_zh": "内嵌于 visual/index.html「跑一枚令牌」章节的离线交互逻辑与数据（本地打包 three.js）：一枚令牌沿主脊从 S1 跑到 S6，进入某段即高亮该段并显示区间名称与场景卡数量；同一时刻线上只允许一枚令牌。支持键盘操作、prefers-reduced-motion 逐段跳转、WebGL 失败与无脚本时的内联静态俯视图回退。挤出高度为示意符号，非建筑体量提案。",
      "description_en": "Logic and embedded data for the “Run a token” section of visual/index.html (three.js bundled locally): one token runs the main line S1→S6, highlighting the occupied section with its name and scenario-card count; only one token may be on the line at a time. Keyboard operable, reduced-motion stepping, and an inline static top-view fallback for no-WebGL and no-JavaScript. Extruded heights are symbolic markers, not a building-volume proposal."
    },
